### Reports
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/top-fruits

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/revenue?from=2025-06-01&to=2025-06-30

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/top-vendor

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/stock-levels

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/outstanding-balances